---
description: MRCD service and package rules; read AGENTS.md first
alwaysApply: true
---

MRCD is a local HTTP service (contract `mrcd.analysis/v1`) and Python package that detects filler words, prolongations and repetitions in Spanish speech. Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root (commands, contract, hard rules, skills index).

Key rules: no auth, bind 127.0.0.1 only; never commit weights, audio or data; never invent API fields (read `mrcd/service/schemas/mrcd.analysis.v1.schema.json`); scores are uncalibrated; absence is never `0`; video never infers psychological states.
